o tecleado\n= registro VERIFICADO", "originalText": "Celular Android: toque NFC\no folio tecleado\n= registro VERIFICADO", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "baseline": 12, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e24", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1040, "y": 100, "width": 400, "height": 490, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ffe3e3", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1048386556, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 351564608, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e25", "type": "text", "x": 1056, "y": 112, "width": 187.00000000000003, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1289560150, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2126508551, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "3 Motor en Valkey", "originalText": "3 Motor en Valkey", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "baseline": 18, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e26", "type": "text", "x": 1056, "y": 146, "width": 331.1, "height": 315.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1475216846, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1927728187, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Sets     personas por programa,\n         municipio, periodo, servicio\n         → únicas e intersecciones EXACTAS\n\nHashes   conteos por unidad\n         (atención, estudio, participación,\n          entrega de insumo)\n\nStream   bitácora de ajustes\n         (nunca se recorta)\n\nSorted Set  ranking de cobertura\n\nPub/Sub  aviso en vivo al tablero\n\nSin nombres: solo claves HMAC.\nSin HyperLogLog: EIRA prohíbe\nestimaciones como cifra oficial.", "originalText": "Sets     personas por programa,\n         municipio, periodo, servicio\n         → únicas e intersecciones EXACTAS\n\nHashes   conteos por unidad\n         (atención, estudio, participación,\n          entrega de insumo)\n\nStream   bitácora de ajustes\n         (nunca se recorta)\n\nSorted Set  ranking de cobertura\n\nPub/Sub  aviso en vivo al tablero\n\nSin nombres: solo claves HMAC.\nSin HyperLogLog: EIRA prohíbe\nestimaciones como cifra oficial.", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "baseline": 12, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e27", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1520, "y": 110, "width": 340, "height": 190, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ffe8cc", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1236683273, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 314395343, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e28", "type": "text", "x": 1532, "y": 120, "width": 84.15, "height": 21.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 507088657, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1795823849, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "4 Tablero", "originalText": "4 Tablero", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAli